{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/be95747b54359a908b53d4b22796a0e4.avif?t=1762509144\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras_big/be95747b54359a908b53d4b22796a0e4.webp?t=1762509144 width=1560 height=504 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY AS A MONKEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br> In I Am Monkey you live behind bars, but your world is full of choices. Visitors come and go - some gentle, some cruel - each one shaping the story of the little Monkey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/147b5e9e4e69faf363c6acfff8ad5055.poster.avif?t=1762509144\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/147b5e9e4e69faf363c6acfff8ad5055.webm?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/147b5e9e4e69faf363c6acfff8ad5055.mp4?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS BASED INTERACTIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grab bananas, snatch cameras, throw objects, swing on cage bars \u2014 the cell becomes a playground of interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/126e62cb783cca88f6fafda7706c1407.poster.avif?t=1762509144\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/126e62cb783cca88f6fafda7706c1407.webm?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/126e62cb783cca88f6fafda7706c1407.mp4?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VISITORS BEHAVIOUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Visitors behave differently: some try to be friend you, others mock, tease, or provoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/84d54a78790777b0663e615cc44dbba1.poster.avif?t=1762509144\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/84d54a78790777b0663e615cc44dbba1.webm?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/84d54a78790777b0663e615cc44dbba1.mp4?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENCOUNTERS &amp; GROWTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock more visitor types or secret items as you react and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/9bd44436b841ef851c6654bf5a2a188c.poster.avif?t=1762509144\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/9bd44436b841ef851c6654bf5a2a188c.webm?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/extras/9bd44436b841ef851c6654bf5a2a188c.mp4?t=1762509144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Monkey</strong> \u2013 Fully immersive VR perspective of a zoo animal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple play styles: </strong>charm, ignore, resist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Visitors</strong> \u2013 Humans who can be cute, friendly, or aggressive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox interactivity</strong>: throw bananas, grab visitors\u2019 objects or the visitors, manipulate your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; variety</strong>: new visitor, new items and modifications.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129360?t=1762509144","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129360?t=1762509144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/5a56a733e7488c5259ee0bd109817cb655f8b51c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762509144","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129360/5a56a733e7488c5259ee0bd109817cb655f8b51c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762509144","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412